silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_05_cannon_or_gpt_absorption_concrete_anchor_3_typed_witness#mittensvetrecordpresheafanchornode3 silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensVetRecordPresheafAnchorNode3 is the typed witness object concretely the Node-or-Arrow-admitted source leg into D_Mittens after the cannon entry has been gated. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'typed_witness', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
